{"3361960": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "MoonStreet: The Playable Movie", "steam_appid": 3361960, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "dlc": [4973830], "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">MoonStreet is a<strong> 2.5D pixel narrative action-adventure </strong>set in the tense, retrofuturistic city of Astro.  You play as scientist <strong>Keith Klipper</strong>, accompanied by robot companion <strong>M.A.X</strong>,  who must uncover the mysteries behind the recent power outages and abductions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong> </strong><br><strong>- IMMERSE INTO GORGEOUS 2.5D PIXEL WORLDS -</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><i>Explore richly detailed 2.5D pixel style worlds packed with animation, secrets, and environmental storytelling </i><br> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361960/extras/c707f6512ffd0bba14754514914c60a3.poster.avif?t=1786755472\" width=1170 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361960/extras/c707f6512ffd0bba14754514914c60a3.webm?t=1786755472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361960/extras/c707f6512ffd0bba14754514914c60a3.mp4?t=1786755472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"><strong>- DUAL CHARACTER CONTROL -</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\"> <i>Control Keith and M.A.X. simultaneously to navigate, investigate and escape from threats</i><br>  <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361960/extras/82aa0326a5513c34d425f4ef157078eb.poster.avif?t=1786755472\" width=1170 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361960/extras/82aa0326a5513c34d425f4ef157078eb.webm?t=1786755472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361960/extras/82aa0326a5513c34d425f4ef157078eb.mp4?t=1786755472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">   <br><strong>- NARRATIVE DRIVEN MYSTERY</strong> -  <br><i>A gripping retro-noir action adventure inspired by events in the financial market </i> <br>   <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361960/extras/28cb3b373683d1c384ea7fbc5250f8d4.poster.avif?t=1786755472\" width=1170 height=486 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361960/extras/28cb3b373683d1c384ea7fbc5250f8d4.webm?t=1786755472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361960/extras/28cb3b373683d1c384ea7fbc5250f8d4.mp4?t=1786755472\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><i> </i></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" style=\"text-align: center\">  <br><strong>- ORIGINAL JAZZ SOUNDTRACK - </strong> <br><i>A rich collection of original jazz compositions to enhance every moment </i> <br><strong> </strong> <br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361960/extras/dc6ec17d0aacf874a9748ca1d5e968d7.poster.avif?t=1786755472\" width=1170 height=624 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3361960/extras/dc6ec17d0aacf874a9748ca1d5e968d7.webm?t=1786755472\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akama